      "is_free": false,
      "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Hidden Object Adventures Where Monsters and Mysteries Collide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where legendary creatures and curious minds meet. These two Hidden Object games combine mystery, monsters, and adventure across vivid 360-degree scenes with rich animation and 3D effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues, collect rewards, and return to quests with new puzzles. Whether you're in it for the thrill or the challenge, there's always more to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search in immersive 360-degree panoramic scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look behind objects, secrets might be hiding out of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay quests with fresh puzzles and bonus rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments inspired by monster legends and lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015080/extras/ddc7ce9d328398a762d21b7a618117e8.avif?t=1757685510\" width=600 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trap for Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of an ancient secret order, sworn to keep the balance between good and evil. Now the order’s powerful amulet has been stolen under the full moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the lairs of mythical creatures including a werewolf, a ghost, a mummy, and a forest spirit. Explore castles, enchanted woods, and hidden chambers as you follow a trail of clues toward the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vampire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young heroine becomes the unwilling player in a vampire’s cruel game. If she succeeds, she earns her freedom. If she fails, she becomes his next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, navigate deadly traps, and collect pieces of a sacred amulet. Escaping the castle is only the beginning. The darkest secrets are still waiting to be revealed.</p>",
      "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two Hidden Object Adventures Where Monsters and Mysteries Collide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where legendary creatures and curious minds meet. These two Hidden Object games combine mystery, monsters, and adventure across vivid 360-degree scenes with rich animation and 3D effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues, collect rewards, and return to quests with new puzzles. Whether you're in it for the thrill or the challenge, there's always more to explore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search in immersive 360-degree panoramic scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look behind objects, secrets might be hiding out of sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay quests with fresh puzzles and bonus rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore environments inspired by monster legends and lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1015080/extras/ddc7ce9d328398a762d21b7a618117e8.avif?t=1757685510\" width=600 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trap for Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of an ancient secret order, sworn to keep the balance between good and evil. Now the order’s powerful amulet has been stolen under the full moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the lairs of mythical creatures including a werewolf, a ghost, a mummy, and a forest spirit. Explore castles, enchanted woods, and hidden chambers as you follow a trail of clues toward the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vampire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young heroine becomes the unwilling player in a vampire’s cruel game. If she succeeds, she earns her freedom. If she fails, she becomes his next meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, navigate deadly traps, and collect pieces of a sacred amulet. Escaping the castle is only the beginning. The darkest secrets are still waiting to be revealed.</p>",
